## SPM
.swiftpm/
.build/

## swiftpm/Package.resolved IS versioned on purpose — do not add it here.
## Xcode Cloud builds with automatic dependency resolution disabled and fails
## with "a resolved file is required" unless the pin file is in the repo. It
## cannot live at its natural path because that is inside the generated
## RemoteSSH.xcodeproj/, which is ignored above; ci_post_clone.sh copies it
## into place after XcodeGen runs.

